  <CLUSTER_HOME>/miniconda3/envs/psi4env/lib/libxc.so.9                            (5.2.3, conda-forge)
  <CLUSTER_HOME>/miniconda3/pkgs/libxc-5.2.3-hfebba4c_0/lib/libxc.so.9             (同一份)
两份库运行时 ctypes 查符号（程序输出见下面 A 节）：非局域网格接口一个都没有，
唯一活着的相关符号是 xc_nlc_coef，而它只回传参数 b/C。
上游核对（libxc tag 7.1.2 的 src/xc.h，经 gitlab files API 取回 30759 字节）：
  line 344  double nlc_b;   /* Non-local correlation, b parameter */
  line 345  double nlc_C;   /* Non-local correlation, C parameter */
  line 598  /* Returns the b and C coefficients for a non-local VV10 correlation kernel */
  line 599  void xc_nlc_coef(const xc_func_type *p, double *nlc_b, double *nlc_C);
  grep -E "xc_nld|xc_nlc_vxc|xc_nlc_xc|XC_NLD" src/xc.h  -> 0 命中
libxc 官方文档原话（https://libxc.gitlab.io/ ，dispersion corrections 段）：
  "... several functionals are available in Libxc that were parametrized with either
   semiclassical dispersion corrections a la Grimme, or various van der Waals
   functionals; neither of these can be evaluated with the local density information
   provided to Libxc, and must be handled by the calling program. The necessary
   parameters for VV10-type correlation kernels are, however, provided by Libxc as
   part of the functional definition."
=> 与符号审计一致：那个双重积分不归 libxc 算，归调用方算（PySCF 的 _vv10nlc、
   ORCA 的 DFT-NL、本仓库的 nlcsplit/nlc.py）。ORCA 锚点里已记着同一件事：
   logs/orca_anchor.json 的 program 字段写 "VV10 handled by ORCA's own DFT-NL, not libXC"。

